---
/** Original line drawing. Not a manufacturer photo. */
---
<figure class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 420 280" role="img">
    <title>A welder power source, a gun, and an outlet</title>
    <rect class="room" x="28" y="36" width="300" height="200" rx="8" />
    <path class="dim" d="M36 28 H320" />
    <text class="dim-label" x="120" y="22">outlet, then the job</text>
    <g transform="translate(58 78)">
      <rect class="deck" x="0" y="36" width="92" height="78" rx="6" />
      <rect class="console" x="12" y="48" width="68" height="22" rx="3" />
      <circle class="wheel" cx="22" cy="122" r="7" />
      <circle class="wheel" cx="70" cy="122" r="7" />
      <path class="upright" d="M92 70 H150" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" />
      <path class="arc" d="M168 96c8-16 18-16 26 0" />
      <rect class="deck" x="188" y="88" width="70" height="8" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <g class="clearance">
      <text x="70" y="214">amps and duty cycle only if published</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="small muted">Original drawing. The arc flickers. Reduced-motion settings keep it still.</figcaption>
</figure>
